{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Coal is a basic resource. It can be obtained primarily from mining rocks, killing ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"s, purchasing from the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],", using a ",["l","煤炭窑","Charcoal Kiln"],", or ",["l","淘盘","panning"],". Coal may also be obtained in a number of other ways."]],["p",["Coal is used in some ",["l","打造","crafting"]," recipes. It is also necessary for smelting items in a ",["l","熔炉","Furnace"]," or ",["l","重型熔炉","Heavy Furnace"]," and smoking fish in a ",["l","熏鱼机","Fish Smoker"],"."]]]],["Locations",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Mining rocks — both in ",["l","矿井","the Mines"]," and anywhere else on the map. The chance to obtain Coal from most rocks is affected by ",["l","运气#Daily Luck","daily luck"],", ",["l","运气#Luck Buffs","luck buffs"],", ",["l","技能#Mining","Mining level"],", the ",["l","采矿#Mining Skill","Prospector Profession"],", and one of the powers from the ",["l","矮人之王雕像","Statue Of The Dwarf King"],"."]],[1,["Mining ",["l","采矿#Coal Node","Coal Nodes"],", which can be found in the ",["l","采石场","Quarry"],", ",["l","采石场矿井","Quarry Mine"],", and ",["l","火山地牢","Volcano Dungeon"],"."]],[1,["Opening coal-filled minecarts and brown miner's bags on certain floors of the Mines and random floors in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"],". Each minecart or bag contains 6 Coal. Minecarts in the Mines refresh their contents each year, while bags do not."]],[1,["Breaking ",["l","矿井#Crates and Barrels","crates and barrels"]," in the Mines, Quarry Mine, Skull Cavern, and Volcano Dungeon."]],[1,["Using ",["l","煤炭窑","Charcoal Kiln"],"s to convert 10 ",["l","木材","Wood"]," into 1 Coal."]],[1,["Recycling ",["l","垃圾（物品）","Trash"]," (30% chance) or ",["l","浮木","Driftwood"]," (25% chance) in a ",["l","回收机","Recycling Machine"],"."]],[1,["Killing ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"],"s between Floors 41-79 of the Mines (50% chance of dropping Coal)."]],[2,["Players may use the elevator to quickly and repeatedly travel between floors ending in 0 or 5 to spawn more Dust Sprites."]],[2,["Using ",["l","怪兽香水","Monster Musk"]," and wearing a ",["l","窃贼戒指","Burglar's Ring"]," may be helpful as well."]],[1,["Killing Red, Purple, and Black ",["l","史莱姆（怪物）","Slimes"],", ",["l","石魔","Stone Golem"],"s, ",["l","荒野石魔","Wilderness Golem"],"s, ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],"s, ",["l","金属大头","Metal Head"],"s, ",["l","暗影狂徒","Shadow Brute"],"s, and ",["l","暗影萨满","Shadow Shaman"],"s. Each monster has a 10% chance to drop Coal."]],[1,["Digging up ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"],"s in the ",["l","边远森林","Backwoods"],", ",["l","深山","the Mountain"],"s, or ",["l","农场","the Farm"],"."]],[1,[["l","淘盘","Panning"]," in any area."]],[1,["Opening regular or golden ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chests"],"."]],[1,["Opening any of the 4 types of ",["l","矿物#Geodes","geodes"],"."]],[1,["The ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," sells Coal for 150g during Year 1 or 250g from Year 2 onwards."]],[1,["The ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]," trades 20 Coal for 1 ",["l","采矿月刊","Mining Monthly"],"."]],[1,["The ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," may sell Coal for 100–1,000g."]],[1,["Up to 50 Coal may be purchased from ",["l","克林特","Clint"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节#Villager Shops","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 5 Calico Eggs ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s each."]],[1,["The ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," outside of the Blacksmith may contain Coal."]],[1,["If a ",["l","果树","Fruit Tree"]," is struck by lightning, it will produce Coal instead of fruit for 4 days before returning to normal."]],[1,[["l","铁路#Trains","Trains"]," may randomly drop Coal."]]]],["p",["Coal purchased at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," costs 150g during Year 1, so it is cheaper in Year 1 to buy 10 wood for 100g from ",["l","罗宾","Robin"]," at the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," and convert that wood into coal in the ",["l","煤炭窑","Charcoal Kiln"],". After Year 1, wood pricing increases to 50g per piece but coal increases to only 250g, so it is cheaper to purchase coal directly."]]]],["Crafting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Bee_House.png",48]],[["l","蜂房","Bee House"]],["Place outside and wait for delicious honey! (Except in Winter)."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×8"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×40"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"],["i","(O)724","Maple Syrup ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," Level 3"]],[[["f","Preserves_Jar.png",48]],[["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"]],["Turns vegetables into pickles and fruit into jam."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×8"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×50"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×40"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," Level 4"]],[[["f","Warrior_Ring.png",46]],[["l","战士戒指","Warrior Ring"]],["Occasionally infuses the wearer with \"warrior energy\" after slaying a monster."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×25"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×10"],["i","(O)84","Frozen Tear ×10"]],[["f","Combat_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","战斗#Combat Skill","Combat"]," Level 4"]],[[["f","Cherry_Bomb.png",48]],[["l","樱桃炸弹","Cherry Bomb"]],["Generates a small explosion. Stand back!"],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×1"],["i","(O)378","Copper Ore ×4"]],[["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿#Mining Skill","Mining"]," Level 1"]],[[["f","Bomb.png",46]],[["l","炸弹","Bomb"]],["Generates an explosion. Watch out!"],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×1"],["i","(O)380","Iron Ore ×4"]],[["f","Mining_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采矿#Mining Skill","Mining"]," Level 6"]],[[["f","Explosive_Ammo.png",48]],[["l","爆炸弹丸","Explosive Ammo"]],["Fire this with the slingshot."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×2"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"]],[["f","Combat_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","战斗#Combat Skill","Combat"]," Level 8"]],[[["f","Wicked_Statue.png",48]],[["l","邪恶雕像","Wicked Statue"]],["There's something unsettling about the looks of this statue."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×5"],["i","(O)390","Stone ×25"]],[["f","Krobus_Icon.png",24],