 Doesn't work with fruit tree crops."],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×10"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×25"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种#Farming Skill","Farming"]," Level 9"]],[[["f","Slime_Egg-Press.png",48]],[["l","史莱姆压蛋器","Slime Egg-Press"]],["Compresses 100 pieces of slime into a slime egg. It's a miracle of science!"],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×25"],["i","(O)82","Fire Quartz ×1"],["i","(O)787","Battery Pack ×1"]],[["f","Combat_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","战斗#Combat Skill","Combat"]," Level 6"]],[[["f","Cookout_Kit.png",48]],[["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"]],["Use this to create a cooking campfire, allowing you to cook on-the-go!"],[["i","(O)382","Coal ×3"],["i","(O)388","Wood ×15"],["i","(O)771","Fiber ×10"]],[["f","Foraging_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","采集#Foraging Skill","Foraging"]," Level 3"]]]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","克林特","Clint"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Dislike"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", ",["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","山姆","Sam"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Coal is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Coal is used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号#Sewing Machine","Sewing Machine"]," with ",["l","布料","Cloth"]," in the feed to create a ",["l","裁缝","Shirt"],". It is a black ",["l","染色","dye"]," when used in the spool of the Sewing Machine with a dyeable clothing item in the feed."]]]],["Quests",2,[["l",0,[[1,["Ten Coal may be requested by ",["l","冰柱鱼","Ice Pip"]," or ",["l","石鱼","Stonefish"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 5 to 7."]],[1,["Ten Coal are requested by ",["l","午夜鲤鱼","Midnight Carp"]," in a ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quest"]," to increase the capacity of the pond from 3 to 5."]]]]]],["Trading",2,[["l",0,[[1,["20 Coal can be traded at the ",["l","大树桩（地点）#Raccoon Wife's Shop","Raccoon Wife's Shop"]," for 1 ",["l","桃花心木种子","Mahogany Seed"],"."]],[1,["999 Coal can be traded at the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," for the ",["l","黑暗钢琴","Dark Piano"],"."]]]]]],["History",2,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","版本历史#1.3.27","1.3.27"],": Increased price from 150g in Year 1 to 250g in Year 2+."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.4","1.4"],": Can now be used in ",["l","裁缝","Tailoring"]," and to create a ",["l","枯萎的花束","Wilted Bouquet"],". Can be requested in ",["l","鱼塘#Quests","Fish Pond quests"],"."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.5","1.5"],": Used to operate the ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],". Used as an ingredient to the ",["l","野炊工具","Cookout Kit"]," recipe. No longer used as an ingredient to the ",["l","骷髅火炬","Skull Brazier"]," recipe."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6","1.6"],": Used to operate the ",["l","熏鱼机","Fish Smoker"]," and ",["l","重型熔炉","Heavy Furnace"],". Can be obtained from ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],"s and Coal Nodes. Can be purchased from ",["l","克林特","Clint"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"],". ",["l","晶球破开器","Geode Crusher"],"s no longer require coal to operate. Can now be traded for the ",["l","黑暗钢琴","Dark Piano"],". Is now requested by ",["l","午夜鲤鱼","Midnight Carp"]," in a Fish Pond quest. Powers from the ",["l","矮人之王雕像","Statue Of The Dwarf King"]," may now affect coal drops."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6.4","1.6.4"],": Coal carts in the Mines now \"refresh\" at the start of each year."]],[1,[["l","版本历史#1.6.6","1.6.6"],": Added Coal for ",["l","桃花心木种子","Mahogany Seed"]," trade at the Giant Stump."]]]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","采矿","Mining"]," • ",["l","灰尘精灵","Dust Sprite"]," • ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"]," • ",["l","煤炭窑","Charcoal Kiln"]," • ",["l","淘盘","Panning"]," • ",["l","回收机","Recycling Machine"]," • ",["l","远古斑点","Artifact Spot"]," • ",["l","钓鱼#Treasure Chests","Fishing Treasure Chest"]," • ",["l","矿物#Geodes","Geodes"]," • ",["l","书摊老板","Bookseller"]]],["Sell Price",["15g"]]]}